 },
 "summary": "SH is a single-row wire-to-board connector system on a 1.0 mm contact pitch: a crimp receptacle housing on the cable mates with a surface-mount shrouded header on the board. Headers come in top-entry (BM, vertical) and side-entry (SM, right angle) styles from 2 to 15 circuits, plus a 20-circuit side-entry size, and are interchangeable with SR-series IDC headers. The SM04B-SRSS-TB is the four-circuit side-entry header, labelled (LF)(SN). Ratings: 1.0 A AC, DC (AWG #28), 50 V AC, DC, -25 to +85 °C.",
